  "description": "Lee Chul-Joong, a team leader in the Jae-Young faction, isn’t thrilled about the arrival of a new director from the entertainment industry. What could someone like that possibly know about \"real\" business? But when Chul-Joong meets the director for the first time—while secretly carrying drugs in his person—things take an unexpected turn. In a twist of fate, he strikes the deal of a lifetime with Director Choi Ha-Gyeong, the perfect deal that could either destroy him or completely turn his world upside down.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes prologue.*",
